3. Check if CSS is actually loading

Open your browser's Developer Tools (F12), go to the "Elements" tab, and inspect the filter card elements. Check if:

· The new CSS classes are showing up in the "Styles" panel
· Any styles are crossed out (overridden)
· The elements have the correct class names applied

